,"premium_pct":461.1,"is_undervalued":false,"pe_trailing":106.9,"pe_forward":94.1,"pb_trailing":2.4,"pb_forward":2.2,"div_yield":0,"ps_ratio":11,"fcf_to_ev":5.05,"fcf_to_mcap":2.27,"liab_to_assets":51.5,"cash_to_assets":2.1,"current_ratio":1.59,"roe":2.2,"roa":1.1,"moat":{"ticker":"JHX","period":"2027Q1","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"James Hardie 在建築材料領域擁有強大的品牌聲譽，尤其是在纖維水泥壁板市場。其品牌代表著品質、耐用性和美觀，這使得公司能夠在一定程度上實現價格溢價，尤其是在高端市場。然而，建築材料市場本質上仍受經濟週期影響，且存在其他品牌競爭，因此定價權並非絕對。品牌價值是其重要的無形資產，但面對成本敏感的客戶群，其定價能力仍有上限。","comment_en":"James Hardie commands a strong brand reputation in the construction materials sector, particularly in fiber cement siding. The brand signifies quality, durability, and aesthetics, allowing for a degree of pricing power, especially in premium segments. However, the inherent cyclicality of the construction market and the presence of competing brands limit its pricing power. While brand equity is a significant intangible asset, cost-sensitive customers cap its ability to command substantial premiums."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"James Hardie 的核心產品纖維水泥壁板的生產技術相對成熟，雖然公司可能擁有與生產工藝或材料配方相關的專利，但這些專利不太可能構成長期、堅不可摧的壁壘。建築材料行業的監管主要集中在安全和環保標準，而非保護特定公司的技術。因此，專利和監管壁壘在這方面提供的保護相對有限。","comment_en":"The manufacturing technology for James Hardie's core fiber cement siding products is relatively mature. While the company may hold patents related to production processes or material formulations, these are unlikely to form a long-term, insurmountable barrier. Regulatory aspects in the construction materials industry primarily focus on safety and environmental standards, rather than protecting specific company technologies. Thus, the protection offered by patents and regulatory barriers in this dimension is limited."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"對於最終消費者而言，更換已安裝的壁板所產生的成本相對較高，涉及拆除、廢棄物處理和重新安裝的費用。對於建築商而言，雖然更換供應商的直接成本不高，但熟悉特定產品的安裝流程和質量標準也存在一定的學習曲線。這種隱含的轉換成本，加上對 James Hardie 產品可靠性的信任，為公司帶來了一定的客戶黏性。","comment_en":"For end consumers, the cost of replacing installed siding is relatively high, involving removal, disposal, and reinstallation expenses. For builders, while direct costs of switching suppliers might not be prohibitive, familiarity with specific product installation processes and quality standards presents a learning curve. These implicit switching costs, coupled with trust in James Hardie's product reliability, contribute to a degree of customer stickiness."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"James Hardie 的業務模式，即生產和銷售建築材料，本質上不具備顯著的網絡效應。其產品的價值和需求主要取決於建築市場的景氣度、產品本身的性能和價格，而非用戶之間的互動或連接。公司與經銷商和建築商的關係是傳統的供應鏈模式，不產生網絡效應帶來的正反饋循環。","comment_en":"James Hardie's business model, focused on manufacturing and selling building materials, inherently lacks significant network effects. The value and demand for its products are primarily driven by the construction market's health, product performance, and pricing, rather than user interactions or connections. Its relationships with distributors and builders follow a traditional supply chain model, not generating the positive feedback loops associated with network effects."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"James Hardie 作為全球領先的纖維水泥產品製造商，其規模經濟效應顯著。龐大的生產量有助於降低單位生產成本，包括原材料採購、生產效率和物流運輸。公司在全球範圍內佈局生產基地，進一步優化了其成本結構，使其在價格競爭中具有優勢，並能更好地抵禦原材料價格波動的影響。","comment_en":"As a leading global manufacturer of fiber cement products, James Hardie benefits from significant economies of scale. High production volumes contribute to lower per-unit costs in raw material procurement, manufacturing efficiency, and logistics. Its global manufacturing footprint further optimizes its cost structure, providing an advantage in price competition and better resilience against raw material price volatility."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":4,"comment_zh":"James Hardie 在北美和澳洲市場擁有領先地位，這些市場對其纖維水泥產品有較高的接受度和需求。公司在全球範圍內擁有生產設施和銷售網絡，使其能夠服務於不同地區的客戶。然而，其業務並非高度依賴於某個單一、獨特的地理位置或資產，而是通過全球佈局來分散風險和擴大市場覆蓋。","comment_en":"James Hardie holds leading positions in North American and Australian markets, where its fiber cement products are well-accepted and in demand. The company operates manufacturing facilities and sales networks globally, enabling it to serve diverse regional customers. However, its business is not critically dependent on a single, unique geographic location or asset but rather leverages global distribution to mitigate risks and expand market reach."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"James Hardie 在生產和供應鏈管理方面展現出較高的營運效率。公司持續投資於自動化和流程優化，以提高生產力並控制成本。其精益生產的理念和對質量控制的嚴格要求，確保了產品的一致性。儘管建築行業的波動性帶來挑戰，但公司通過有效的營運管理，維持了相對穩定的盈利能力。","comment_en":"James Hardie demonstrates high operational efficiency in its production and supply chain management. The company consistently invests in automation and process optimization to enhance productivity and control costs. Its lean manufacturing principles and stringent quality control measures ensure product consistency. Despite the challenges posed by the cyclical nature of the construction industry, the company maintains relatively stable profitability through effective operational management."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"James Hardie 的管理層在資本配置方面表現出較為審慎和明智的策略。公司在維持核心業務的同時，也積極尋求透過有機增長和選擇性併購來擴張。其對股東回報的承諾，體現在持續的股票回購和股息支付上。公司能夠在經濟週期中有效管理現金流，並將資本投入到能夠產生長期價值的項目中。","comment_en":"James Hardie's management exhibits a prudent and intelligent capital allocation strategy. While strengthening its core business, the company actively pursues expansion through organic growth and selective acquisitions. Its commitment to shareholder returns is evident in consistent share buybacks and dividend payments. The company effectively manages cash flow through economic cycles, directing capital towards projects that generate long-term value."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"James Hardie 通過提供高品質、耐用的產品和可靠的客戶服務來培養客戶忠誠度。其品牌聲譽和產品性能是吸引重複購買和推薦的關鍵因素。對於建築商而言，與供應商建立穩定的合作關係，以及對產品性能的信任，有助於提高客戶留存率。然而，市場競爭和價格壓力意味著客戶忠誠度並非牢不可破。","comment_en":"James Hardie fosters customer loyalty by delivering high-quality, durable products and reliable customer service. Its brand reputation and product performance are key drivers for repeat purchases and referrals. For builders, establishing stable relationships with suppliers and trusting product performance contribute to customer retention. However, market competition and pricing pressures mean that customer loyalty is not absolute."},"m10_durability":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"James Hardie 的纖維水泥產品以其耐用性、抗火、抗蟲蛀和耐候性而聞名，這使得產品本身具有較長的生命週期。這種產品的持久性為公司帶來了穩定的需求基礎。儘管建築行業受經濟週期影響，但對高品質、長壽命建材的需求具有一定的韌性。公司的業務模式相對穩定，不易受到快速技術變革的顛覆。","comment_en":"James Hardie's fiber cement products are known for their durability, resistance to fire, pests, and weathering, giving the products a long lifespan. This inherent longevity provides a stable demand base for the company. While the construction industry is cyclical, the demand for high-quality, long-lasting building materials shows resilience. The company's business model is relatively stable and not prone to disruption from rapid technological shifts."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"James Hardie 展現出一個具有堅固護城河的建築材料企業，其核心競爭力來自於強大的品牌定價權（M1）和顯著的規模經濟成本優勢（M5）。公司在北美和澳洲市場的領導地位，加上其產品的耐用性（M10）和相對較高的轉換成本（M3），共同構成了穩定的客戶基礎。管理層在資本配置（M8）方面的審慎態度也為長期價值增長提供了支持。雖然缺乏網絡效應（M4）和專利壁壘（M2），但其營運效率（M7）和客戶關係（M9）進一步鞏固了其市場地位。整體而言，James Hardie 類似一個擁有強大品牌和規模優勢的『收費橋』模式，能夠在波動的市場中持續產生穩健的回報。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"James Hardie presents a building materials company with a robust economic moat, primarily driven by strong brand pricing power (M1) and significant cost advantages from economies of scale (M5). Its leading positions in North America and Australia, coupled with product durability (M10) and relatively high switching costs (M3), create a stable customer base. Prudent capital allocation (M8) by management further supports long-term value creation. While lacking network effects (M4) and strong patent barriers (M2), its operational efficiency (M7) and customer relationships (M9) solidify its market standing. Overall, James Hardie operates akin to a 'toll bridge' model, leveraging brand strength and scale to generate consistent returns in a cyclical market.","evidenceHash":"dc070e155d537355f943234f62368300640d82aea3c5a304639a25646b18b4f4","assessmentPolicy":"us-buffett-moat-v3"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":6,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2026-03-31","period":"FY 2026","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"grey","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T16:12:46.364Z","evidenceHash":"6ad06dd6b75b7cea9899639a05af0503c235d9ef3ae563753716ed78d629d315"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2026-03-31","period":"FY 2026","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"highRisk","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T16:12:46.364Z","evidenceHash":"6ad06dd6b75b7cea9899639a05af0503c235d9ef3ae563753716ed78d629d315"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/JHX.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/JHX.png","website":"https://www.jameshardie.com","ceo":"Aaron Erter","full_time_employees":"7500","description":"James Hardie Industries plc (JHX) operates as a prominent global producer and supplier of construction materials, focusing on fiber cement, fiber gypsum, and cement-bonded solutions. These products are utilized for both internal and external building applications across key markets including the United States, Australia, Europe, New Zealand, the Philippines, and Canada. The company's activities are organized into three primary business segments: North America Fiber Cement, Asia Pacific Fiber Cement, and Europe Building Products. Its extensive portfolio of fiber cement offerings encompasses interior wall linings, exterior cladding systems, and associated complementary items. James Hardie also provides various fiber cement components suitable for a broad spectrum of uses, such as external panels, internal partitions, flooring, ceilings, eaves, decorative trim, fencing, and architectural facades. Additionally, the firm delivers fiber gypsum and cement-bonded boards tailored for specific purposes, including structural fire protection, dry lining installations, timber frame construction, and do-it-yourself projects. These versatile materials are widely adopted in diverse construction sectors, notably new home building and commercial property development. Established in 1888, James Hardie Industries plc maintains its corporate headquarters in Dublin, Ireland.","description_en":"James Hardie Industries plc (JHX) operates as a prominent global producer and supplier of construction materials, focusing on fiber cement, fiber gypsum, and cement-bonded solutions. These products are utilized for both internal and external building applications across key markets including the United States, Australia, Europe, New Zealand, the Philippines, and Canada. The company's activities are organized into three primary business segments: North America Fiber Cement, Asia Pacific Fiber Cement, and Europe Building Products. Its extensive portfolio of fiber cement offerings encompasses interior wall linings, exterior cladding systems, and associated complementary items. James Hardie also provides various fiber cement components suitable for a broad spectrum of uses, such as external panels, internal partitions, flooring, ceilings, eaves, decorative trim, fencing, and architectural facades. Additionally, the firm delivers fiber gypsum and cement-bonded boards tailored for specific purposes, including structural fire protection, dry lining installations, timber frame construction, and do-it-yourself projects. These versatile materials are widely adopted in diverse construction sectors, notably new home building and commercial property development. Established in 1888, James Hardie Industries plc maintains its corporate headquarters in Dublin, Ireland.","description_zh":"**James Hardie Industries plc (JHX) 業務營運概述**\n\nJames Hardie Industries plc (JHX) 為全球領先的建材製造商與供應商，專注於纖維水泥、纖維石膏及水泥複合材料解決方案。其產品廣泛應用於美國、澳洲、歐洲、紐西蘭、菲律賓及加拿大等主要市場的建築內外裝飾。\n\n公司業務劃分為三大核心板塊：北美纖維水泥、亞太纖維水泥，以及歐洲建材產品。其纖維水泥產品線涵蓋室內牆板、外牆飾板系統及相關配件，並提供多樣化的纖維水泥組件，適用於外牆板、室內隔間、地板、天花板、屋簷、裝飾線條、圍籬及建築立面等多元用途。此外，JHX亦提供專為結構防火保護、乾式隔間、木結構建築及DIY專案設計的纖維石膏與水泥複合板材。這些多功能材料廣泛應用於新建住宅及商業地產開發等建築領域。JHX成立於1888年，總部位於愛爾蘭都柏林。","address":"One Park Place","city":"Dublin","state":"DU","zip":"D02 FD79","country":"IE","phone":"353 1 411 6924","full_address":"One Park Place, Dublin, DU D02 FD79, IE","range_52w":"16.46-31.43","year_high":31.43,"year_low":16.46,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":16.46,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-10-05","name":"KONG-PICARELLO JENNIFER","title":"director: ","is_buy":null,"action":"","shares":0,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-09-17","name":"PETERSON RENEE J","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":743,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-09-17","name":"Hendrickson Gary E","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":1140,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-09-17","name":"Rowland Suzanne B","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":748,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-09-17","name":"Stein Nigel","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":903,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-09-17","name":"Singh Jesse G","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":744,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-09-17","name":"HECKES HOWARD C","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":1268,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-09-17","name":"Pfeifer John C","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":751,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-09-17","name":"Sindel Alan Robert Harold","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":1224,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-08-27","